{#-
  Values for the pinned cilium chart (WP-48). The cilium CLI kurin used
  to drive installed the same chart with exactly these settings; the
  chart ignores `nativeRoutingCIDR` (removed upstream), so the new
  values drop it: tunnel mode stays the chart default, exactly what the
  CLI-era clusters ran.

  k8sServiceHost/Port must stay explicit: on a single-node kubeadm CP
  the `kubernetes.default.svc` endpoint is not routable yet while cilium
  itself is the CNI being installed.

  The CN zone swaps the image registries to the DaoCloud mirrors and
  drops the digest pins (the mirrors do not serve upstream digests).
-#}
ipam:
  mode: kubernetes
k8sServiceHost: {{ k8s_service_host }}
k8sServicePort: {{ k8s_service_port }}
operator:
  replicas: 1
{%- if mirror %}
  image:
    repository: {{ mirror_operator }}
    useDigest: false
image:
  repository: {{ mirror_cilium }}
  useDigest: false
{%- endif %}
